Package: zenith
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Zenith OS <zenith@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mohitjoer/Zenith-OS
Depends: libc6, git
Recommends: hyprland
Description: Zenith OS control tool
 Reads machine hardware out of sysfs, resolves which hardware profile claims the
 machine and at what support tier, and manages the overlay that makes an update
 safe: a user's override wins at its mirrored path and no update can clobber it.
 .
 This package installs the control tool and the hardware profile database. It is
 configuration data and the binary; it installs no kernel, no bootloader and no
 driver, and it is the only Zenith package that writes outside
 /usr/share/zenith/ and /etc/zenith/ by way of its executables in /usr/bin.
